WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.600
I'd like to formally ask you

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:04.137
to be the next chief executive
of this company.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.171
(SOFTLY) Yes.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.106
-♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪
-(CROWD CLAMORING)

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:09.041
To fight this takeover,
we keep close.

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.476
<i> The whole family.</i>

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:14.246
<i> I saw their plan,
 and my dad's plan was better.</i>

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:15.581
I swear to God, Dad,

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:16.816
if you bring him back,
I am walking...

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:18.050
♪ (MUSIC STOPS) ♪

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.286
...back to my office,
to... sulk.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.589
-♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪
-We're going for Pierce.

00:00:23.122 --> 00:00:24.257
SHIV ROY:<i> Buying PGN?</i>

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.226
-Who told you?
-Am I not supposed to know?

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.694
There are no rules.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:30.730
-Ow! Security!
-Back off!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.198
This is executive-level
business!

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:34.367
<i> You saw what your dad did
 to Kendall.</i>

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.036
He could do the same to you.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.507
Rhea Jarrell.
And you must be Oedipus Roy.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.109
The Pierce family knows
what you're after,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.310
and they're not interested.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.546
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:48.881
-Twenty-one billion dollars.
-Dad.

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:50.483
-What? I'm a mere conduit.
-22 billion.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.218
Is he allowed
to just say numbers?

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.287
Twenty-four.
And they can trust me.

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.158 line:0%
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

